UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'The Iron Horde - or whatever Gul''dan is turning them into - has fallen back and fortified the entrance to Tanaan. A direct assault will take a heavy toll.$b$bHowever, the sea lanes are open. If we attack by both land and sea, Gul''dan''s Horde will have no quarter. $n, it''s time to build a shipyard!$b$bWe''ll need to source local resources. Travel to the Iron Docks, where a small Alliance reclamation force is already waiting. Gather what equipment you can, and find us a shipwright capable of building a fleet!' WHERE `ID` = 38257 AND (`QuestDescription` IS NULL OR `QuestDescription` = '');
