UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'Whatever be left of da Iron Horde be fallin'' back ta Tanaan Jungle, where Gul''dan is turnin'' them into sumthun'' even worse. A frontal assault be suicide.$b$bBut da seas be open. If we attack by both land an'' sea, Gul''dan got ta fall back somewhere. $n, it be time ta build a shipyard!$b$bWe need local resources. Go to da Iron Docks. Gazlowe''s boys are already there. Gather any equipment ya find, and see if ya can recruit us a proper Horde Shipwright!' WHERE `ID` = 38568 AND (`QuestDescription` IS NULL OR `QuestDescription` = '');
