UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'I''ve been doing a little digging - or whatever you call digging in naval terms. Snorkeling?$b$bGul''dan has sent his most powerful flagship on a scouting mission to the four corners of Draenor. He is mapping out all the oceanic ley-line conjunctions. This is information that I could use to upgrade your ring... But in Gul''dan''s hands, it could be catastrophic.$b$bScramble the fleet, $n! Hunt down his infamous flagship, "The Master''s Call," and steal that map before they complete their mission. Hurry!' WHERE `ID` = 39697 AND (`QuestDescription` IS NULL OR `QuestDescription` = '');
